think-queue-stream

The task API and ThinkPHP integration are inspired by topthink/think-queue:
https://github.com/top-think/think-queue (Apache License 2.0).
Original project copyright: top-think and its contributors.

This package implements a new Redis Streams transport and worker in the
ThinkQueue\Streams namespace. It is not an official topthink release and is
not a binary-compatible replacement for every think-queue feature.
